{"id":"selinuxdefcon.8","n":"selinuxdefcon","s":"8","src":{"r":{"pkg":"libselinux-utils","ver":"3.6-3.el9","repo":"BaseOS","url":"https://dl.rockylinux.org/vault/rocky/9.6/BaseOS/x86_64/os/Packages/l/libselinux-utils-3.6-3.el9.x86_64.rpm","path":"/usr/share/man/man8/selinuxdefcon.8.gz","sha256":"0903fc2340c50a16178e8260dd6fe1f48578cf604088eb91f8aa591b441b1127","date":"7 May 2008","origin":"dwalsh@redhat.com"}},"nopt":{"r":0},"desc":"report default SELinux context for user","r":[["NAME","<p>selinuxdefcon - report default SELinux context for user</p>"],["SYNOPSIS","<p><b>selinuxdefcon [-l level] user fromcon</b></p>"],["DESCRIPTION","<p><b>selinuxdefcon</b> reports the default context for the specified user from the specified context</p> <p><b>-l level</b> mcs/mls level</p>"],["EXAMPLE","<p># selinuxdefcon jsmith system_u:system_r:sshd_t:s0 <br> unconfined_u:unconfined_r:unconfined_t:s0-s0:c0.c1023</p>"],["AUTHOR","<p>This manual page was written by Dan Walsh &lt;dwalsh@redhat.com&gt;.</p>"],["SEE ALSO","<p>secon(8), selinuxconlist(8)</p>"]]}